<H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Shadowjack's Introduction to BatMUD Commands </H1>
<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>


<p>This guide is intended as a quick reference guide for experienced LPmud players who are new to BatMUD.  Although this guide is meant for players already familiar with LPmuds, newbies might also benefit from some of the tips presented here.</p>

<p>This introduction is <em>not</em> meant to replace BatMUD's extensive <a href="http://www.bat.org/help/help.php" target="bat.org">help files</a>.  The help pages will always be more informative and provide details not mentioned here.  This guide points out differences between BatMUD commands and other LPmuds', and highlights some of the more useful commands.</p>

<hr width="50%"/>

